<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94401" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑτομετρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deal out portions of corn</i> or <i>provisions</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				75
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				13.58
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. σῖτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					47.12
				</span></i>
			; <i>hold office of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτομέτρης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				3.516
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cadyanda</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> trans., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. δύναμιν</span>
			<i>supply</i> a force <i>with provisions, victual</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.63.10
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δῆμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				389.15
			</span></i> (Aegiale, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ πεζοὶ σιτομετροῦνταί
			τι</span> they <i>have</i> it <i>served out</i> as
				<i>rations</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.39.13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				3.679
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tlos</span>).— <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				360
			</span></i>, Thom.Mag.<i><span class="en">
				p.335
			</span></i> R., object to the word, preferring <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον μετροῦμαι</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
